[Desktop Entry]
Name=Cross Bible
Comment=CrossBible is a cross platform bible reader. It can download a lot of free bibles for many languages from ebible.org and crosswire.org. It displays the bible text in columns for easier reading, as your print bible does.
Icon=/usr/share/pixmaps/crossbible.png
Exec=/usr/bin/crossbible
Terminal=false
Type=Application
Categories=Utility
GenericName=CrossBible
Keywords=Bible,Bible Reader,Cross Bible
StartupWMClass=crossbible